<title>USA: GST Telecommunications buys Action Telcom.</title>
<headline>GST Telecommunications buys Action Telcom.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER, Wash. 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>GST Telecommunications Inc said it acquired Abilene, Texas-based Action Telcom Co, which will continue its business as GST Action Telcom Inc.</p>
<p>Under the terms of the agreement, GST acquired Action Telcom for a purchase price consisting of GST common stock, cash and notes.</p>
<p>Action Telcom posted revenues in excess of $12 million for 1996 and generated positive EBITDA in excess of $700,000.</p>
</text>
